                "details": [
                    "[Tactical] Adjust -> Gravity Lift: adjusted visual effects of the lift to reduce visual load on the battlefield, adjusted audio of players in the lift to be more noticeable."
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Loba": [
            {
                "patch": "The Astral Anomaly Event (2025-01-06)",
                "details": [
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Black Market: ultimate starts with 99% charge (was 50%), added griefing protection, can now be remotely picked-up", 
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Can now grab banners (does not consume a Black Market usage), can now open vaults without a key, but no EVO is awarded.",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Small meds (shield cells and syringes) no longer consume a Black Market usage.",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Burglar's Best Friend: now has two charges, reduced Tac toss time slightly and recovery time significantly.",
                    "[Passive] Buff -> Eye for Quality: Loba can ADS when unarmed to see the loot UI for items highlighted by her passive.",
                    "[Perks] Buff -> Shopping Spree: reworked to allow entire squad to take 3 items from a friendly Black Market", 
                    "[Perks] Removed -> High Value",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Market Expansion",
                    "[Perks] New -> Wolf’s Claws: gain speed boost and significantly faster weapon draw after a teleport.",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Tactical Upgrad",
                    "[Perks] New -> Brand New Bag: entire squad receives gold backpacks when selected", 
                    "[Perks] New -> Escape Artist: Loba can regenerate 50 shield HP after teleporting with her Tac, damage stops the regen."
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Mirage": [
            {
                "patch": "The Astral Anomaly Event (2025-01-06)",
                "details": [
                    "[Passive] Buff -> Now You See Me…: now also cloaks when using a healing consumable item, entering cloak now only takes 1s (was 1.5s), after a revive, Mirage now has increased speed while cloaked.",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> More Me",
                    "[Perks] New -> Boozle-Eye: Bamboozles now also scan the target who shot the clone",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Battpack: in addition to the extra battery per stack, this upgrade now also shows battery counts in Death Boxes.", 
                    "[Perks] New -> Renaissance Man: gain access to all other Classes’ world interactions: Assault Bins, Care Package scans, Survey Beacons, and Ring Consoles."
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Pathfinder": [
            {
                "patch": "The Astral Anomaly Event (2025-01-06)",
                "details": [
                    "[Tactical] Nerf -> Grappling Hook: cooldown increased to 30s (was variable)", 
                    "[Perks] Nerf -> Insider Knowledge: reduced Max Cooldown earned from Scanning Care Packages, reduced zipline change gained by Scanning Care Packages.",
                    "[Passive] Nerf -> Zipline Zen: damage reduction reduced to 25% (was 50%)."
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Vantage": [
